   This document gives some additional requirements for running the PF and
CCTEST tests.


   1) The server must be a HPFS386 enhanced server
   2) The server must have the MULTI directory on an HPFS386 partition for
      the PF test
   3) The server must share an HPFS386 partition for both the PF and CCTEST
      tests
   4) The workstations must be logged on as ADMIN PASSWORD for both PF and
      CCTEST, in order to avoid any problems with user priviledges
